      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how heavy that feeling of social silence and disconnection is, and I want you to know that being \"invisible\" or \"disgusted\" at the surface level is a common human response to difficult change, even when it feels unbearable. The fact that you are able to articulate this pain and seek understanding means a vital part of you still wants to exist and be better than the \"ghost\" you harmed. Please consider talking to a therapist who can help you navigate this grief; they can offer support to help you find a way through this void.",
      "source": "target",
